  "SubGoals": [],
  "Description": "The GetSqlObject goal extracts SQL and SQL parameters from the provided data. It filters the Parameters list to find the item with Name 'sql' and retrieves its Value, storing it in the variable \\%sql\\%. It also filters for the item with Name 'sqlParameters' to get its Value and stores it in \\%parameters\\%. Finally, it returns the extracted \\%sql\\%, \\%parameters\\%, along with the Name from \\%data.Name\\% and ReturnValues from \\%data.ReturnValues\\%. This goal requires the data to contain a Parameters list with specific items to function correctly.",
